### Obtener checkpoints y trayecto de una ruta — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getRouteInformation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeId": 1
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getRouteInformation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeId": 1
}

### RouteId inválido (0) → 400 (requerido y mayor que 0)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getRouteInformation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeId": 0
}

### RouteId inexistente → 200 con listas vacías
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getRouteInformation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeId": 999999999
}
